+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
+ * Diagonal hatch motifs (the "/" striped disc and striped square)
+ *
+ * Both are a fan of 45-degree bars clipped to an outline. Each bar is a
+ * quadrilateral: it walks along the (1,1) normal in steps of `pitch`, and
+ * its two ends sit on the outline's chord at that offset.
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
